      "Congregations-without-adherent-counts: 331 county-level rows report congregations but no adherent figure, covering 509 congregations statewide (all traditions). Of those, 306 rows / 477 congregations are Evangelical Protestant. Those congregations ARE counted in evangelicalCongregations but contribute ZERO to evangelicalAdherents, so evangelical adherents are systematically UNDERSTATED and notEvangelical is correspondingly OVERSTATED. Per-county magnitude is exposed as evangelicalCongregationsWithoutAdherentCount."
